{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "94e5168c-bdf4-4c00-b873-26a1a9368165",
    "name": "SIR - API Gestão de Alunos",
    "description": "Testes CRUD de alunos e cursos.\n\nA variável baseUrl decide a API:\n- API simulada (json-server): http://localhost:3000\n- API real local (Express): http://localhost:5000/api\n- API real no Render: https://<servico>.onrender.com/api\n\nCorrer a coleção pela ordem (Run collection): 'Listar cursos' guarda o cursoId e 'Criar aluno' guarda o alunoId usados nos pedidos seguintes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Cursos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar cursos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cursos",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cursos"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const cursos = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Devolve uma lista com cursos', () => pm.expect(cursos).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty);",
                  "// Guarda o id do primeiro curso para os pedidos de alunos",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('cursoId', cursos[0].id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('cursoIdJson', JSON.stringify(cursos[0].id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Obter curso por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cursos/{{cursoId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cursos",
                "{{cursoId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Tem nomeDoCurso', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().nomeDoCurso).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar curso",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cursos",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cursos"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nomeDoCurso\": \"Engenharia Informática\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const c = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Nome correto', () => pm.expect(c.nomeDoCurso).to.equal('Engenharia Informática'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('novoCursoId', c.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar curso (PUT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cursos/{{novoCursoId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cursos",
                "{{novoCursoId}}"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nomeDoCurso\": \"Engenharia Informática (PL)\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Nome atualizado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().nomeDoCurso).to.equal('Engenharia Informática (PL)'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Apagar curso",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cursos/{{novoCursoId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cursos",
